    "_why_declared_plus_remainder": "Only the heavy test ids are named. Everything else is gathered at run time into one remainder unit. A test ADDED to a split module therefore lands in the remainder automatically - it cannot be silently dropped from the suite. A DECLARED id that disappears (a rename) fails the build closed, which is the case a computed complement would otherwise absorb silently while handing one shard ~20 minutes of unaccounted work.",
